OL,3,GNEWSA'Last in line' wooden fishing boat
OL,4,Ato be restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe final wooden fishing boat to work
OL,7,Ffrom Hastings beach is to be saved
OL,8,Fafter thousands of pounds were raised
OL,9,Ftowards its restoration.
OL,11,FSo far, #5,400 has been donated to fund
OL,12,F"modifications and repairs needed to
OL,13,Fensure the long term preservation" of
OL,14,Fretired vessel RX58 Felicity, which was
OL,15,Fbuilt in 1980 and deregistered two
OL,16,Fyears ago.
OL,18,FThe plan is to transfer the boat,
OL,19,Fdescribed as "a proud reminder of the
OL,20,Ftown's ancient working maritime
OL,21,Ftradition", to its new home outside The
OL,22,FDolphin Inn on the seafront.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
