OL,3,GNEWSA'Last in line' wooden fishing boat
OL,4,Ato be restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner Peter Carney, from volunteer
OL,7,Fgroup Hastings Wooden Boats, called the
OL,8,F32 ft (10m) long Felicity "the last of
OL,9,Fher line in so many ways".
